    "summary_one_sentence": "When their father dies under mysterious circumstances, estranged half-brothers Jonny and James team up to uncover a dangerous conspiracy tied to their family's past.",
    "summary_short": "After learning of their father's sudden and suspicious death, estranged half-brothers Jonny and James are forced to reunite despite years of personal rift. Their search for answers quickly plunges them into a shadowy network of criminal activity and hidden family secrets. As danger mounts around them, the duo must reconcile their differences to survive the unfolding threat. Ultimately, uncovering the truth requires confronting a conspiracy that could shatter their family legacy forever.",
    "summary_long": "The sudden and mysterious death of their father forces estranged half-brothers Jonny and James to cross paths after years of distance. Despite their contrasting personalities and deeply rooted rivalries, both brothers are driven by a shared need to discover what truly happened. As they begin investigating his final days, they discover a trail of buried secrets that links their father to high-stakes crime and political corruption. Their relentless digging attracts the attention of dangerous operatives determined to keep the truth hidden at all costs. Shifting between explosive high-octane action and sharp, comedic banter, the brothers navigate a web of deception that pushes their bond to its absolute limit. Along the way, they encounter unexpected allies and treacherous betrayals, realizing that their father's past was far more complex than either had ever imagined. Each revelation brings them closer to a massive conspiracy threatening not just their lives, but the stability of their entire community. To bring the orchestrators to justice, Jonny and James must learn to trust each other again and leverage their combined strengths. In a dramatic final showdown, the brothers face off against the mastermind behind their father's death to protect what remains of their family.",
    "synopsis": "The Wrecking Crew is a high-energy blend of action, drama, and comedy that follows two estranged half-brothers, Jonny and James, who are pulled back together by tragedy following their father's mysterious death. Driven by grief and unanswered questions, the mismatched duo embarks on an investigation that uncovers a deep-seated conspiracy woven with crime, hidden identities, and dangerous family secrets. Balancing explosive confrontation with lighthearted brotherly friction, the film delivers an engaging mystery as the brothers race against the clock to expose the truth before those responsible eliminate them.",
